* refresh_op.spice -- closed-loop row refresh operation (sense -> write-back), issue #110
* GENERATED by gen_refresh_op.py; do not edit by hand.
*
* PROPOSED/UNRATIFIED SCOPE: corners/temperatures (27 C, 125 C, five global corners, 1.8 V)
* come from spec/operating-range-decision-PROPOSED.md. CIRCUIT BODY for `klt sim`.
*
* One op = precharge (rbl/ref to VRBL/VREF) -> RWL select -> latch enable at select+SENSE ->
* (+T_LATCH) WWL pulse of width WB with the latch COMPLEMENT node `ref` connected to WBL
* (stored '1' pulls rbl down, so ref goes high and writes '1') -> +T_GUARD release of
* latch, WBL connection and RWL -> SN read T_MEAS later.
