* sense time, w<ns> = WWL pulse (p = decimal point). refw = in-deck reference write:
* SN from 0 V, ideal 1.8 V WBL, 20 ns WWL (the 'post-write level' the restore test is
* measured against). w0p2 = NEGATIVE CONTROL pulse (too short; must be flagged unrestored).
