* ASSUMPTIONS (none is a spec value): ideal switches for precharge / WBL connect (100 ohm),
* ideal WWL/RWL/enable drivers, C_RBL = C_WBL = 10 fF (not extracted), 4-row column all rows
* at one level, ideal matched dummy reference load, reference = VRBL - 100 mV, latch sizes
* (first pass), T_LATCH and T_GUARD fixed, global corners only (no mismatch).

